HelloAgents TypeScript is an adaptation of HelloAgents Python.

Upstream project: https://github.com/jjyaoao/HelloAgents
Upstream license: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0

HelloAgents-go (https://github.com/chaojixinren/HelloAgents-go) is consulted
as a cross-language implementation reference. The top-level `skills/` content
is synchronized from its skill repository:
https://github.com/chaojixinren/HelloAgents-go/tree/main/skills

The synchronized skill content is part of the HelloAgents upstream project
and remains available under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-
ShareAlike 4.0 International License.
